{{term|''[[au gratin]]''}}
{{defn|Prepared in the {{gli|gratin}} style. Foods served ''au gratin'' are topped with breadcrumbs or cheese then {{gli|browning|browned}} under a broiler.<ref name="NLGgratin">{{cite book |last=Montagné |first=Prosper |date=1977 |title=The New Larousse Gastronomique |url=https://archive.org/details/newlaroussegastr00mont_0/page/296 |publisher=The Hamlyn Publishing Group Ltd |page=[https://archive.org/details/newlaroussegastr00mont_0/page/296 296] |isbn=0-517-53137-2 }}</ref>}}

